# Implementation Plan - Goal Analyzer Feature

This plan outlines the steps to implement the **Goal Analyzer** feature as requested. This feature will provide a visual breakdown of how Scholarium processes a user's goal into a structured learning path.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> The Goal Analyzer will be shown as a transition state after a user submits a goal. It replaces the current simple loading spinner with a detailed, step-by-step analysis animation.

